              "body": "I think it should appear in SUBSCRIBE_TRACKS and then echo'd in PUBLISH.  But we might want to include defaults in the Setup Option, particularly for cases like PUBLISH without SUBSCRIBE_TRACKS?\n\n```suggestion\nSUBSCRIBE or PUBLISH that establishes a subscription, where it sets the\n```",
