    {
      "number": 3,
      "id": "PR_kwDOU86eg88AAAABG0KrqQ",
      "title": "Add Setup Options for initial subscription flow control limits",
      "url": "https://github.com/afrind/draft-frindell-moq-subscription-flow-control/pull/3",
      "state": "MERGED",
      "author": "afrind",
      "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "Addresses review feedback on PR #1 about subscriptions created by a PUBLISH that was not in response to SUBSCRIBE_TRACKS.\r\n\r\n* Add INITIAL_MAX_SUB_STREAMS (0x0C) and INITIAL_MAX_SUB_BYTES (0x0E) Setup Options. If omitted, the initial limit is 0.\r\n* Both limits now always apply when the extension is negotiated. SUBSCRIBE or SUBSCRIBE_TRACKS can override an initial limit, including with a smaller value; PUBLISH echoes the SUBSCRIBE_TRACKS value.\r\n* Remove the rule that a limit absent at establishment does not apply, which contradicted the zero-credit default for PUBLISH.",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-06T00:08:19Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-07T04:09:07Z",
      "baseRepository": "afrind/draft-frindell-moq-subscription-flow-control",
      "baseRefName": "main",
      "baseRefOid": "f7399d25a7fe806823e44d0cc36942c5f5b17a09",
      "headRepository": "afrind/draft-frindell-moq-subscription-flow-control",
      "headRefName": "initial-limit-setup-options",
      "headRefOid": "98d7e91cf94aac28f631f94068a69027379fa80d",
      "closedAt": "2026-10-07T04:09:04Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-10-07T04:09:04Z",
      "mergedBy": "afrind",
      "mergeCommit": {
        "oid": "8a3bf52928c332f162b9de1ac04f131d39aa2975"
      },
      "comments": [],
