      "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "Addresses review feedback on PR #1 asking whether limits must always increase. SUB_FLOW_CONTROL_UPDATE values were already added to the current limit; state that explicitly so limits never decrease.\r\n\r\nAs in HTTP/2 WINDOW_UPDATE, a publisher that receives an update with a delta of 0 closes the session with a PROTOCOL_VIOLATION.",
