            },
            {
              "originalPosition": 10,
              "body": "This paragraph is all about the reset case, so I wonder if it's be better to split the previous paragraph at \"When a publisher resets a stream,\" and put this paragraph at the end of that?",
              "createdAt": "2026-10-06T21:37:02Z",
